abstract: >
  Triadic Reality Theory v2 is the candidate canonical repository for a
  foundational-ontology research programme built on three irreducible
  co-primitives: L3 as ontological logical constraint, I-infinity as
  unbounded informational representability, and A as fundamental state
  transition. Representability, admissibility, actualizability, and
  actuality are kept distinct and separately typed. This repository is a
  candidate, not yet promoted; the v1 repository remains the authoritative
  historical baseline until a JD-approved promotion ADR.
